Critical release gate
The existing payout flow sends from ALBUKHR's Testnet app wallet to the recipient. The current SQL also charges fee amounts against project reward/capital reserves. This does not implement the approved rule that the person requesting a withdrawal pays a separate fee while the recipient receives the full requested amount. The plan therefore requires a separately authorized and server-verified Pi payment for the fee before the payout (unless the architecture team proves an equivalent user-funded balance mechanism exists). Do not enable withdrawals until this entire flow is verified end-to-end.
The additive SQL draft creates the future policy/assessment tables with the policy inactive. It does not patch current RPCs or enable features. It is not a production-ready or complete migration.
